<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Titus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Titus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus ḏ axeddam n Arebbi ḏ arrasul n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ <char style="it">xeddmeɣ</char> ƹlaḥsab yinni ig ixḍar Arebbi bac aḏ amnen aḏ ssnen lḥaqiqa iy ṯen isegguren ɣar min iǧan nican ḏi lʼiman. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Lʼiman-a ḏ ṯusna-ya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> ṯbedda x lʼamal n ṯuḏarṯ nni war ifennin ƹemmarṣ, ṯenni iy zi iwƹeḏ Arebbi iƹni wenni war isxerriqen ca. Iwƹeḏ s ṯuḏarṯ nni qbeȓ ma aḏ bḏan zmanaṯ qaƹ. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />U ḏi lweqṯ nni ig ixḍar netta ismeḍhar-d lwaƹed-a s ttebcir nni iy zi ḏayi itwakellef s lʼamar n Arebbi wenni iy ḏaneɣ isnejmen.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />
    <char style="it">Tariɣ ṯabrat-a</char> i Titus wenni iy iǧan am memmi ḏ ṣṣaḥ ḏi lʼiman-a iy ḏi ncarrec. Akiḏec yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy ḏaneɣ isnejmen.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ x imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />X manayenni jjiɣ-cek ḏi <char style="it">ṯeyzirṯ n</char> Krit, aḏ tƹeḏȓeḏ min tuɣa rezzuɣ nec aḏ ƹeḏȓeɣ war uwiḍeɣ ca u ƹaweḏ bac aḏ tixḍareḏ imeqqranen <char style="it">n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</char> ḏi mkuȓ abilaj am mammec iy c weṣṣiɣ. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Ameqqran-a maci aḏ yiȓi ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem tƹeyyaben-ṯ yiwḏan. Aɣares ṯiȓi ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ waha aḏ iȓin iḥenjiren nnes ḏ ȓmuminin. Maci axasen inin yiwḏan teggen lmadella n ssekra niɣ war tseḏḥin ca. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Aqa arrayes n jmaƹeṯ itkellaf netta s lmesʼuliya zi Arebbi u labud aḏ yiȓi bȓa ȓƹib, war ḏayes itiȓi bu ttakebbur, war itƹeṣṣib ca ḏeɣya, war isekkar ca s ccreb, war icciṯ ca, war iḍemmeƹ ca ḏi tmenyaṯ. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Wah, itxeṣṣa aḏ itreḥḥab zeg inewjiwen, aḏas iteƹjib min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan, aḏ iḥkem x ṯnefsiyṯ nnes, aḏayes yiȓi lmaƹqul, aḏ yiȓi iṣfa, aḏ irebba ixef nnes. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Itxeṣṣa u labud aḏ iṭṭef mliḥ ḏeg wawaȓ nni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ttiqeṯ iy ḏas itwasȓemḏen ḥima aḏ icejjeƹ iwḏan s yijjen n ttaƹlim nican aḏ inha yinni itƹarraḍen i ttaƹlim-a.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Liʼanna yinni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ṯɣennant aqaṯen mujudin, ssawaȓen waha niṯni ḏ iɣeddaren xaṣṣatan ḏ yinni iticcen lhimma aṭṭas i ṭṭahareṯ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṭṭahareṯ nettaṯ ḏ aḥejjem niɣ ḏ axṯan niɣ ḏ lxitam.</char></note> <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Yina aqemmum nsen itxeṣṣa-yasen aḏasen itwaqqen. Niṯni mecḥaȓ n lƹaʼilaṯ kemȓent iy sparḏȓen wami ḏasen seȓmaḏen ṯimesȓayin itxeṣṣa-yasen war ḏasen ṯent seȓmiḏen ca, niṯni ḍemmƹen ḏi tmenyaṯ waha. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Ijjen zzaysen ḥessben-ṯ ḏ nnabi netta s yixef nnes inna: "Niṯni Ayṯ-Krit ȓebda ḏ ayṯ-buyixarriqen ḏ ȓuḥuc iwƹaren ḏ imaƹgazen ḏaysen aƹeddis waha." <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Aqa chaḏeṯ nni iy inna nican iy ṯeǧa. Iḏen, nha-ṯen s ȓeqsaḥeṯ ḥima aḏ iȓin nican ḏi lʼiman. <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Maci aḏ ggen array i ṯḥuja nni n Ayṯ-Israʼil niɣ aḏ ggen array i ȓuṣiyaṯ nni n yinni isbeƹƹaḏen ixef nsen zi lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Aqa yinni ig iǧan ṣfan ataf qaƹ ṯimesȓayin aḏaysen iȓint ṣfant. Walakin yinni ixenzen war uminen ca ataf war ḏaysen tiȓi uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ ṯeṣfa. Ataf ȓƹaquȓaṯ nsen ḏ ḍḍamiraṯ nsen s ṯnayen texnizen. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Qqaren qa nessen Arebbi walakin nekkaren-ṯ s ȓefƹayeȓ nsen. Niṯni twaƹiffen, war tṭiƹin ca, war neffƹen ca uȓa ḏeg yijjen n ȓxeḏmeṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ƹlaḥsab ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Amma cek, seȓmaḏ min imunen ak ttaƹlim nican. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Yinni imɣaren aḏaysen yiȓi lmaƹqul, aḏ iȓin mweqqrin, aḏ ḥekmen x ṯnefsiyṯ nsen, aḏ iȓin nican ḏi lʼiman ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ ṣṣbar.<verse eid="TIT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Ṯinni imɣaren ƹaweḏ aḏ ƹiccent ƹlaḥsab lʼiman, war ḏaysent tiȓi bu nnamima, war tebliyint ca aṭṭas s binu. Aḏ sȓemḏent min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan. <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />Amenni aḏ rebbant ṯimɣarin ṯimezyanin ḥima aḏ texsent iryazen nsent ḏ ṯarwa nsent, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />aḏ ḥekment x ṯnefsiyṯ nsent aḏ iȓint ṣfant, aḏ ggent ccɣeȓ ḏi ṯeddarṯ nsent, aɣarsent yiȓi wuȓ ḏ acemȓaȓ, aḏ ṭaƹent i iryazen nsent ḥima awaȓ n Arebbi war itwaƹeyyib ca.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Ammu ƹaweḏ in-asen i iḥenjiren aɣarsen yiȓi ȓaƹqeȓ nsen. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin aɣarsen ṯiȓiḏ cek ḏ lmiṯal s lḥasanaṯ iy teggeḏ. Ttaƹlim nnec sexḏem-iṯ s ṣṣaraḥa ḏ lmaƹqul <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />ḏ yijjen n wawaȓ ḏ ṣṣaḥ war ḏayes bu ȓƹib. Ammu ac seḏḥan yinni ḏac itƹarraḍen minzi war ɣarsen min xaneɣ ɣa inin.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Isemɣan aḏ ṭaƹen i ayṯbab nsen ḏi kulci, axasen arḍan, war ḏasen teggen ca ṯaɣennant, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />war tacaren ca <char style="it">ayṯbab nsen</char> bac aḏ ssnen belli niṯni ḏaysen marra ttiqeṯ bac s marra ibriḏen aḏ zewwqen lʼiman n Arebbi iy ḏaneɣ isnejmen.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Cuf, arḍa n Arebbi itmeḍhar-asen-d i marra iwḏan itawi-ṯen ɣar mani ɣa twasnejmen. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Arḍa-ya itrebba-yaneɣ a nenkar ccarr ḏ ccehawaṯ n ddunect-a, a nƹic ḏi zman-a a neḥkam x ṯnefsiyṯ nneɣ aḏayneɣ yiȓi lmaƹqul ḏ lʼiman <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />u neccin ɣir netraja lʼamal nni itwabarken iƹni <char style="it">Nhar nni</char> iy ḏayes d ɣa ṯmeḍhar lƹaḍama n Arebbi Ameqqran ḏ Umsenjem nneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Netta iṣeddeq xaneɣ ixef nnes ḏ ijjen n lfidya x marra ccarr nneɣ u ƹaweḏ bac aḏ issiṣfa ijjen n ccaƹb i yixef nnes ataf aḏ iȓin nnes mujudin aḏ ggen lḥasanaṯ.<verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Siweȓ x ṯmesȓayin-a, zeyyar <char style="it">x ȓmuminin</char> nehha-ṯen s marra ssulṭa. War tejja ḥadd ac iseḥqar.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s">Abriḏ n yinni iḏeffaren Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Sfekkar i ȓmuminin aḏ ggen array i ȓḥukkam ḏ ȓmexzen, aḏasen ṭaƹen aḏ iȓin wejḏen i kuȓ ȓxeḏmeṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" /><char style="it">Sfekkar-aṯen</char> ḥima war tƹeyyiben ḥadd, war tmenɣin ca s wawaȓen, aḏ iȓin trankiȓ, aḏ sxeḏmen ijjen n ttawaḍuƹ ak marra iwḏan.<verse eid="TIT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Cuf, neccin ƹaweḏ tuɣa ḏayneɣ ijjen n ȓeqfaȓeṯ, war netṭiƹi ca, netwacemmeṯ, ḥekkment xaneɣ aṭṭas n lʼanwaƹ n ccehawaṯ ḏ zzhu. Tuɣa netƹic ḏeg yijjen n ȓeqbaḥeṯ ḏ ȓeḥseḏ, ƹiffen-aneɣ yiwḏan, netƹiffa ayawya. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Walakin wami d imeḍhar ȓxir ḏ lḥanana n Arebbi wenni iy ḏaneɣ isnejmen <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />ȓexddenni isenjem-aneɣ maci ƹlaḥsab lḥasanaṯ nni iy negga; Lla, tuɣa ƹlaḥsab arraḥmeṯ nnes netta. Issireḏ-aneɣ s waman n uxȓaq ḏ jḏiḏ, yarra-aneɣ ḏ jḏiḏ s ufus n Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Arruḥ-a ifareɣ-iṯ-iḏ xaneɣ Arebbi s yijjen n ȓxir imɣar s ufus n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy ḏaneɣ isnejmen. <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />Ḥima a nwareṯ zzayes, aɣarneɣ yiȓi ijjen n lʼamal n ṯuḏarṯ ṯenni war ifennin ca liʼanna nmeṣȓaḥ ak Arebbi s arḍa nnes. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Awaȓ-a iy qqareɣ ḏayes ttiqeṯ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Nec xseɣ cek aḏ twekkḏeḏ x ṯmesȓayin-a i yinni iy yumnen zi Arebbi bac aḏ d arren ȓbaȓ nsen aḏ ṭewwƹen ixef nsen s lḥasanaṯ. Ṯimesȓayin-a ḏ ṯiṣebḥanin s waṭṭas neffƹent iwḏan. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Walakin siggwej ixef nnec zeg imnaqaren iy ḏi ṯeǧa ɣir ṯubuhȓiya u ƹaweḏ zi lbaḥt nni n ṯcejjura n ȓejḏuḏ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayṯ-Israʼil tuɣa teggen aṭṭas n lbaḥṯ ḏi ȓejḏuḏ nsen bac aḏ ssnen ma ɣarsen ccurfa ḏi ṯcejjarṯ n ȓejḏuḏ nsen. Arrasul Bulus iqqar-asen lbaḥṯ nni war ineffeƹ s walu.</char></note> ḏ imenɣiwen ḏ imxarwaḍen x ccariƹa liʼanna niṯni ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ waha war neffƹen ca qaƹ. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Wenni ismenɣan iwḏan ag wayawya cek ƹȓem-as ṯwaȓa ṯamezwarut ḏ wis ṯnayen ȓexddenni awggwej zzayes qaƹ. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Ṯessneḏ illa bnaḏem-a iƹeṣṣa ḏ amƹewwaj, lƹiqab nnes x yiȓi nnes.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Xmi ḏawem d ɣa ssekkeɣ <char style="it">umaṯneɣ</char> Artimas niɣ ḏ Tuciq, egg lmejhud nnec aɣari d ṯaseḏ ɣar ṯendint n Nikupris minzi nec tuɣa fekkareɣ aḏ seƹḏuɣ ḏinni ȓmecta. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Ƹlaḥsab <char style="it">ayṯmaṯneɣ</char> Apullus ḏ Zinnas wenni iy iǧan ḏ awkiȓ, egg lmejhud nnec bac aṯen ṯƹawneḏ ḏeg ubriḏ nsen; Xzar ma ɣarsen marra min teḥḏajan. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Iwḏan nneɣ itxeṣṣa war tƹicen ca bȓa nnfaƹ, itxeṣṣa aḏ ṭewwƹen ixef nsen s lḥasanaṯ ḥima aḏ debbaren i yina iteḥḏajan.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Sawwaḍen-ac-d sȓam marra yinni iǧan akiḏi. Siweḍ-asen sȓam i yinni iy ḏaneɣ itexsen ḏi lʼiman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa i marra kenniw.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>